{"headword":"מוּל²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. circumcise (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּל</span> <em>cut off</em> but only seemingly in the dub. passages (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מָלַל³\" href=\"/BDB,_מָלַל³\", dir=\"rtl\">III.</a> [<a data-ref=\"BDB, מָלַל³\" href=\"/BDB,_מָלַל³\", dir=\"rtl\">מָלַל</a>] and Comm.) <a data-ref=\"Job 14:2\" href=\"/Job.14.2\">Jb 14:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 18:16\" href=\"/Job.18.16\">18:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 24:24\" href=\"/Job.24.24\">24:24</a> [ms. Levy], <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:2\" href=\"/Psalms.37.2\">ψ 37:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:6\" href=\"/Psalms.90.6\">90:6</a>. (grass, etc.: only for iii. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָלַל</span>, q.v.); cf. NH <span dir=\"rtl\">מָהַל</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">מְהַל</span>, according to Thes Nö<sup>ZMG xl. 1886, 741</sup> Ba<sup>ib. xli. 1887, 626</sup> v. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, מָהַל\" href=\"/BDB,_מָהַל\", dir=\"rtl\">מהל</a> supr.<strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָל</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:4\" href=\"/Joshua.5.4\">Jos 5:4</a> + 2 times; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְתָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:44\" href=\"/Exodus.12.44\">Ex 12:44</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָ֫לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:5\" href=\"/Joshua.5.5\">Jos 5:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:7\" href=\"/Joshua.5.7\">7</a>; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְתֶּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.16\">Dt 10:16</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫מָל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:23\" href=\"/Genesis.17.23\">Gn 17:23</a> + 2 times; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:2\" href=\"/Joshua.5.2\">Jos 5:2</a>; Pt. pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.24\">Je 9:24</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֻלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:5\" href=\"/Joshua.5.5\">Jos 5:5</a>;—<em>circumcise</em>, c. acc. <span dir=\"